				\mathbb{E} [\eps_k]   \le  \frac{2L D^2}{k+1}
				+  \frac{\hat{L}D^3}{nk(k+1)}\sum_{t=1}^{k}t~\frac{134 n}{t+1} \le \frac{2L D^2}{k+1}
				+  \frac{134 \hat{L}D^3}{k+1} \ , 
